{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46818","headline":"谢人惠十才子图 · 齐己","name":"谢人惠十才子图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹青妙写十才人，玉峭冰棱姑射神。\n醉舞离披真鸑鷟，狂吟崩倒瑞麒麟。\n飜腾造化山曾竭，采掇珠玑海几贫。\n犹得知音与图画，草堂闲挂似相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}